# Getting started with clingo_elixir

```elixir
Mix.install([
  {:clingo_elixir, path: Path.expand("../..", __DIR__)},
  {:kino, "== 0.19.0"}
])

Code.require_file(Path.expand("../support/course.exs", __DIR__))
alias ASPCourse, as: Course
alias Clingo.Control
```

Choose an entry point, read copied results, sample lazy models and manage native state deliberately.

Run top to bottom. Worked examples check their stated answers; update those checks when editing ASP. Exercise templates are deliberately incomplete. File-based sections create their own disposable workspace; download edits before that section’s cleanup. All solving uses the Elixir wrapper.

